= The End of Valorum's Term

Finis Valorum survived the Naboo crisis, but he has served the two terms the constitution allows. He leaves office tired and bruised, with a quiet warning to the Caucus: "Someone engineered that blockade to bring me down. I could never prove who."

The Core Moderates nominate **Davan Quill of Brentaal**, a cautious party manager, to succeed him. The election of a new Supreme Chancellor follows at once.
